{"format":1,"id":"koerperreise","kurz":"kr","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Körperreise im Liegen","untertitel":"Mit der Aufmerksamkeit langsam durch den Körper wandern, von den Füßen bis zum Kopf.","haltung":["liegen","im_bett"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":true,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":720},"lang":{"ziel_s":1500}},"kb":1426,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/1.3f0e0b9a.mp3","ms":7232,"text":"Leg dich bequem auf den Rücken. Ein Kissen unter dem Kopf und unter den Knien kann helfen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/2.9ed4d178.mp3","ms":2699,"text":"Die Arme liegen locker neben dem Körper.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/3.a3c95339.mp3","ms":6096,"text":"Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Offen lassen ist genauso in Ordnung.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/4.8f45b4f9.mp3","ms":7966,"text":"Du kannst jederzeit aufhören. Und du kannst jede Stelle überspringen, die sich nicht gut anfühlt.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/5.25fdd10b.mp3","ms":6100,"text":"Bei dieser Übung musst du nichts verändern. Du spürst nur, was da ist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/6.1d2f80d6.mp3","ms":4329,"text":"Auch wenn du an einer Stelle gar nichts spürst, ist das in Ordnung.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/7.1d56de83.mp3","ms":4329,"text":"Lass dir Zeit. Es gibt nichts zu erreichen.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/8.f4243812.mp3","ms":5642,"text":"Spür zuerst den Atem. Wie er von allein kommt und geht.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/9.87456c51.mp3","ms":8938,"text":"Und spür, wo dein Körper aufliegt. Die Fersen, die Waden, das Becken, der Rücken, der Hinterkopf.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/10.6d6463fc.mp3","ms":2060,"text":"Du darfst ganz schwer werden.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"fuesse","segmente":[{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/11.0ea94b9c.mp3","ms":4254,"text":"Wandere mit deiner Aufmerksamkeit hinunter zu den Füßen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/12.a056d6f7.mp3","ms":3613,"text":"Zu den Zehen, den Fußsohlen, den Fersen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/13.5d2320ce.mp3","ms":5411,"text":"Vielleicht spürst du Wärme oder Kühle, ein Kribbeln oder den Kontakt zur Decke.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/14.d6e225d6.mp3","ms":3131,"text":"Spür jetzt die Fußrücken und die Knöchel.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/15.4365444c.mp3","ms":7889,"text":"Wenn du magst, stell dir vor, der Atem fließt bis hinunter in die Füße. Und wieder hinaus.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"beine","segmente":[{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/16.0084af3a.mp3","ms":5836,"text":"Geh weiter zu den Unterschenkeln. Zu den Waden und den Schienbeinen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/17.b183a967.mp3","ms":1261,"text":"Zu den Knien.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/18.8cfebe77.mp3","ms":6123,"text":"Und zu den Oberschenkeln. Vorne, hinten, innen und außen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/19.988c21e1.mp3","ms":7908,"text":"Spür das rechte Bein. Und dann das linke. Vielleicht fühlen sie sich verschieden an.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/20.bdbd5a76.mp3","ms":4556,"text":"Spür jetzt deine ganzen Beine, von den Füßen bis zur Hüfte.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":33.3,"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"rumpf","segmente":[{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/21.d7e300eb.mp3","ms":3304,"text":"Wandere weiter zum Becken und zum Gesäß.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/22.f0043258.mp3","ms":6215,"text":"Zum Bauch. Vielleicht spürst du, wie er sich mit dem Atem hebt und senkt.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/23.20b81810.mp3","ms":1585,"text":"Zum unteren Rücken.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/24.9f0ace6f.mp3","ms":3519,"text":"Zum oberen Rücken, zwischen den Schulterblättern.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/25.9a216206.mp3","ms":4289,"text":"Zur Brust. Auch hier bewegt sich der Atem.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/26.a0dac928.mp3","ms":7068,"text":"Wenn du irgendwo Spannung spürst, atme sanft dorthin. Du musst sie nicht wegmachen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"arme","segmente":[{"id":"s027","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/27.4cd80f55.mp3","ms":8860,"text":"Lenke die Aufmerksamkeit jetzt zu deinen Händen. Zu den Fingerspitzen, den Handflächen, den Handrücken.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s028","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/28.f8cb51e3.mp3","ms":2925,"text":"Zu den Handgelenken und den Unterarmen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s029","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/29.f81c1483.mp3","ms":2789,"text":"Zu den Ellenbogen und den Oberarmen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s030","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/30.90b52958.mp3","ms":5635,"text":"Und zu den Schultern. Wenn sie etwas sinken wollen, lass sie sinken.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s031","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/31.0ee704dc.mp3","ms":5242,"text":"Spür beide Arme zugleich, von den Fingerspitzen bis zu den Schultern.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":33.3,"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"kopf","segmente":[{"id":"s032","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/32.86f4d966.mp3","ms":2591,"text":"Spür jetzt den Nacken und den Hals.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s033","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/33.f022edc4.mp3","ms":5962,"text":"Den Kiefer. Vielleicht dürfen sich die Zähne ein wenig voneinander lösen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s034","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/34.6082457b.mp3","ms":2902,"text":"Die Lippen, die Wangen, die Nase.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s035","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/35.bc6adf36.mp3","ms":4010,"text":"Spür die Luft, die an der Nase ein- und ausströmt.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"s036","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/36.2ccbe811.mp3","ms":2233,"text":"Die Augen und die Augenlider.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s037","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/37.202c0342.mp3","ms":2077,"text":"Die Stirn und die Schläfen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s038","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/38.c26d73c5.mp3","ms":3412,"text":"Und den ganzen Kopf, bis hinauf zum Scheitel.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"ganz","segmente":[{"id":"s039","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/39.047ebfcd.mp3","ms":6483,"text":"Spür jetzt deinen ganzen Körper auf einmal. Von den Füßen bis zum Kopf.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s040","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/40.5192b685.mp3","ms":3461,"text":"Wie er liegt. Wie er atmet.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s041","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/41.2e6a9966.mp3","ms":3128,"text":"Einfach da sein, so wie du gerade bist.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":33.3,"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}},{"id":"s042","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/42.518c2b6a.mp3","ms":7112,"text":"Wenn die Gedanken gewandert sind, ist das in Ordnung. Komm einfach zurück zum Spüren.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":37.7,"lang":87.9}},{"id":"s043","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/43.4bf90143.mp3","ms":4205,"text":"Der Atem fließt durch den ganzen Körper, ganz von allein.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st09","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":87.9}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s044","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/44.ec3d7ee1.mp3","ms":2608,"text":"Langsam kommt die Übung zum Ende.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s045","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/45.2b56e2aa.mp3","ms":6346,"text":"Wenn du schlafen möchtest, bleib einfach so liegen. Du musst nichts mehr tun.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5},"modus":"wach"},{"id":"s046","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/46.f1cfd0e3.mp3","ms":4789,"text":"Wenn du aufstehen möchtest, atme etwas tiefer ein und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5},"modus":"wach"},{"id":"s047","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/47.e38b72a4.mp3","ms":5593,"text":"Beweg die Finger und die Zehen. Streck dich, wenn du magst.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8},"modus":"wach"},{"id":"s048","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/48.a42f8054.mp3","ms":2886,"text":"Öffne die Augen, wenn du so weit bist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5},"modus":"wach"},{"id":"s049","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/49.2d70a8ee.mp3","ms":3189,"text":"Roll dich zur Seite und steh langsam auf.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3},"modus":"wach"},{"id":"s050","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/50.7893111d.mp3","ms":4510,"text":"Bleib einfach so liegen. Du musst nichts mehr tun.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5},"pegel_db":-5,"modus":"schlaf"},{"id":"s051","art":"sprache","datei":"kr/51.4c249c56.mp3","ms":5893,"text":"Ich werde jetzt still. Ruh dich aus. Gute Nacht.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3},"pegel_db":-7,"modus":"schlaf"},{"id":"st10","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":60,"normal":120,"lang":180},"ende_stille":true,"modus":"schlaf"},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende","modus":"wach"}]}]}